## Reply templates

### Reply 1 — Interested comment
Thanks — DM me and I’ll send access details. I’m asking early users to test Nexus on a real workflow and send direct feedback.

### Reply 2 — DM opener
Thanks for wanting to try Nexus. I’m offering free access in exchange for feedback. Best next step: use it on one real workflow, then send what worked, what confused you, and what would make it better.

### Reply 3 — Qualification
What kind of workflow would you test Nexus on? Codebase exploration, planning, implementation, debugging, terminal automation, or something else?

### Reply 4 — Feedback request
After you try it, can you send: what you used it for, what helped, what confused you, and whether you would use it again?

### Reply 5 — Follow-up
Checking in — did you get a chance to try Nexus on a real workflow? Even short feedback is useful.

